Subject: [mistral.rs] paged-rows-as-kernel-inputs

  The engine's scheduled rows as the paged kernels' inputs: one row per query token, a block table and a visible-key count per row, the slot mappings uploaded once per device.

Applies to: 962112d18ea5729fe7acaae5085ce54c2fb66dab
Files: 1

